flowchart TD
  A([Start: Open /login]) --> B[Enter Email & Password]
  B --> C[Submit Form]
  C --> D{Check Rate Limit: 5 failures?}
  D -- Yes --> E[Lock for 5 minutes, Display Error] --> B
  D -- No --> F{Validate in DB: user exists & password hash matches?}
  F -- No --> G[Increment Failed Attempts, Display Error] --> B
  F -- Yes --> H{Is Account Active?}
  H -- No --> I[Display Deactivation Notice] --> B
  H -- Yes --> J[Clear Failed Attempts & Regenerate Session]
  J --> K{Check Role}
  K -- OWNER --> L[Redirect to /dashboard]
  K -- STAFF --> M[Redirect to /home]
  L --> Z([End])
  M --> Z
